{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超與越南國家主席蘇林在深圳進行雙邊會談。李家超表示，越南是香港在全球第三大以及在東盟內最大貿易夥伴，去年雙邊貿易額上升75％，增長強勁。<br/>\n<br/>\n 李家超提到，2024年到訪越南期間，雙方達成30項涵蓋不同範疇的合作備忘錄，兩地交流愈趨頻繁。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：汪溟曦 \t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.221737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:18:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:21.987991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:55.128669+00:00","content_hash":"1ba69862dc4f749c4e0ff3cf5b0ac208b8cd32ac0445484ceec753ff5b29b663","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}